<p>You manipulate the spacetime continuum in such a way that you switch places with another creature with in a range of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 8, 9.</acronym>  The targeted creature will be confused (power <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 20%, 30%, 40%, 50%</acronym>) for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns.</p><p>The spell's hit chance will increase with your Spellpower.</p>